  "youtube_description": "This is an oldie but a goodie, guaranteed to get a laugh--and send the actor running for the showers. \n\n#YMCACampErdman #Oahu #BananaBandana \n\nI'm Kat Fitzpatrick, writer, teacher, outdoor educator. I missed my first calling as an actress and fruit smoosher but it's never too late to revisit your dreams!!\n\nAbout my writing philosophy and classes:  \nWriting and journaling are great ways to enhance our experience of life. Writing together is fun and enlivening. There's so much to write about and discover! I hope you'll consider writing on your own or comment if you'd like to attend my fun classes.\n\nCheck out: The \"Let's Practice Together\" Learning Community for Writing, Reading, and Listening: https://practicetogether.substack.com/p/welcome \n\nRead about my family/history project at: \"Stories of Vietnam\"\nhttps://katfitzpatrick.substack.com/p/introducing-stories-of-vietnam\n\nI was one of the few American dependents living in Saigon at the end of the Vietnam War, the daughter of a CIA operative who worked in ultra-secret propaganda. See my book links below.\nFind out more at https://kat-fitzpatrick.com/\n\nMy recent book, For the Love of Vietnam:  a war, a family, a CIA official, and the best evacuation story never heard, paperback or ebook is available on Amazon or on Bookshop.org (benefits local bookstores).\nAmazon: https://a.co/d/2PdmbQT\nBookshop: https://bookshop.org/a/7847/9798988581109",
